### Update and Return Data (TypeScript & SQL)

Source: https://github.com/drizzle-team/drizzle-orm-docs/blob/main/src/content/docs/pg/update.mdx

Updates a row and retrieves specified columns from the updated record using the `.returning()` method in Drizzle ORM.

```typescript
const updatedUserId = await db.update(users).set({ name: "Mr. Dan" }).where(eq(users.name, "Dan")).returning({ updatedId: users.id });
```

